      "question": "If x + 1/x = √3, find x¹⁸ + x¹² + x⁶ + 1.",
      "options": {
        "A": "0",
        "B": "1",
        "C": "2",
        "D": "3"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Property: If x+1/x=√3, x⁶=-1. Sum = 0.",
      "hash": "7de228f920c641eb",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि x + 1/x = √3 है, तो x¹⁸ + x¹² + x⁶ + 1 का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "0",
            "B": "1",
            "C": "2",
            "D": "3"
          },
          "explanation": "यदि x+1/x = √3, तो x⁶ = -1 होता है। (-1)³ + (-1)² + (-1) + 1 = -1 + 1 - 1 + 1 = 0."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mathematics-04-028",
      "number": 28,
      "question": "From 5 Men and 4 Women, how many ways to form committee of 4 with at least 2 women?",
      "options": {
        "A": "81",
        "B": "80",
        "C": "85",
        "D": "75"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Cases: 2W2M, 3W1M, 4W. Sum = 60+20+1 = 81.",
      "hash": "055fcd91fc7a0d6b",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "5 पुरुषों और 4 महिलाओं में से 4 लोगों की एक समिति कितने तरीकों से बनाई जा सकती है यदि उसमें कम से कम 2 महिलाएं हों?",
          "options": {
            "A": "81",
            "B": "80",
            "C": "85",
            "D": "75"
          },
          "explanation": "मामले: (2W, 2M) + (3W, 1M) + (4W, 0M). (4C2×5C2) + (4C3×5C1) + (4C4×5C0) (6×10) + (4×5) + (1×1) = 60 + 20 + 1 = 81."
        }
      }
    },
